  "details": "It can be hard to allocate cameras, audio, and your avatar parameters. So, rather than climbing the hill to learn OSC or try to fenangle the send/revievers, just a menu for a nearby person in-world to communicate avatar 3.0 parameters smoothly as float, bool, or int with their labels. Configurable by reciever as what they want to put forth, and as sender with a confirmation prompt. I'd finally have a reason to pay for VRC+ if it were in there as an additional feature to ease content creation flow.",
